[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17947.59, "timestamp": "04:59:07", "text": "呃，他有m，我不会接受munchet。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17949.868, "timestamp": "04:59:09", "text": "我还是选别的吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17953.948, "timestamp": "04:59:13", "text": "东西。他们给了我男人。呃，没什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17958.03, "timestamp": "04:59:18", "text": "呃，没有其他办法让我回去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17961.19, "timestamp": "04:59:21", "text": "几个月。哦，过段时间再去拜访他们吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17963.23, "timestamp": "04:59:23", "text": "几个月。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17966.15, "timestamp": "04:59:26", "text": "天哪，那太好了。谢天谢地，事实并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17988.31, "timestamp": "04:59:48", "text": "很多。哦，这是一种新型的箱子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17989.07, "timestamp": "04:59:49", "text": "一个"}]